  "releaseNotes": "SDK 0.2.3: VectorQuery.EfSearch (HNSW candidate list size) and LabelFilter.RequiredMode (All, the server default, or Any), LabelMatchModes constants, and the VectorEfSearch and LabelFilterRequiredMode capability constants. Against a current server: an existing DocumentKey is a 409, a key repeated in a batch is a 400, updating a missing document is a 404, and an update that leaves Labels or Tags null keeps them.",
